# PHP conventions

Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) for full context.

## Structure

- Partials: `assets/partials/` — included from `index.php`, `story-shell.php`.
- Story pages: `stories/<slug>/index.php` → `stories/view.php` → `assets/story-shell.php`.
- Shared logic: `assets/helpers.php`, `assets/story.php`.

## Output

- Escape: `e($value)`
- Strings: `t('key')` — add keys to `assets/i18n.php`
- Icons: `icon('name', ['size' => 16])`

## Preferences

PHP reads language prefs from cookies (`readalong-read`, etc.). Client writes via `setLangPref()` (localStorage + cookie). Do not use Brio storage for prefs.

## New UI

Wire chrome with Brio attributes in partials; implement handlers in the matching JS file (`home.js`, `scripts.js`, `onboarding.js`).
